{"2899350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "House Of Decay", "steam_appid": 2899350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tommy loses his brother under mysterious circumstances, and every clue leads to a world of demons!<br>Can he find him? 👁️👁️👁️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most heroes end up in other worlds through portals or ominous prophecies. Tommy got there because he got drunk and accidentally performed a ritual correctly. <strong>YOU’RE IN FOR ONE HELL OF A TRIP:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUMP OR DIE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/d555e28d0ab8b6081ba0da2502f878c1.poster.avif?t=1788211445\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/d555e28d0ab8b6081ba0da2502f878c1.webm?t=1788211445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/d555e28d0ab8b6081ba0da2502f878c1.mp4?t=1788211445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leap across chasms, grind rails, pull off tricks, and unlock new abilities.</strong> They’ll let you reach places you couldn’t get to before—and gradually change the way Tommy looks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRANGE NEW FACES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/9916008f2ef1db86b02e6d133a18bf22.poster.avif?t=1788211445\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/9916008f2ef1db86b02e6d133a18bf22.webm?t=1788211445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/9916008f2ef1db86b02e6d133a18bf22.mp4?t=1788211445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the charismatic inhabitants of the demon world.</strong> They tend to say some pretty unpleasant things to Tommy... Yeah, there’s definitely something wrong with them. But you might still end up being useful to each other.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A CREEPY BLOODBATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/21c2bfe08b96cee99b2a0a2cac2bbaae.poster.avif?t=1788211445\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/21c2bfe08b96cee99b2a0a2cac2bbaae.webm?t=1788211445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/21c2bfe08b96cee99b2a0a2cac2bbaae.mp4?t=1788211445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not everyone is happy to see Tommy!</strong> You’ll face all kinds of enemies, each with their own behavior and attack patterns: study them, dodge, hit back, and keep pushing forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT PETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/868bdcb5d68cb0648a724b5f380be0a4.poster.avif?t=1788211445\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/868bdcb5d68cb0648a724b5f380be0a4.webm?t=1788211445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/868bdcb5d68cb0648a724b5f380be0a4.mp4?t=1788211445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect crystals, unlock new pets, and bring your favorites along.</strong> And yes, you can dress them up too—just like Tommy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AND THAT’S NOT ALL:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 completely different locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique looks made from dozens of customization items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EVEN MORE pets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles hidden all over the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A familiar PS1 / PSX aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An UNFORGETTABLE dream breakcore soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shortcuts that unlock new routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive controls and full Steam Deck support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💖 Play the demo now and join our Discord! 💖</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/5efaff51e43262c52296c97e1aaae869.poster.avif?t=1788211445\" width=1170 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/5efaff51e43262c52296c97e1aaae869.webm?t=1788211445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/5efaff51e43262c52296c97e1aaae869.mp4?t=1788211445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tommy loses his brother under mysterious circumstances, and every clue leads to a world of demons!<br>Can he find him? 👁️👁️👁️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most heroes end up in other worlds through portals or ominous prophecies. Tommy got there because he got drunk and accidentally performed a